            "review_title": "Review at Sen Ha Thanh",
            "review_text": "Trang N\nHanoi, Vietnam18 contributions\n0\nGood demonstration\nOct 2013 • Family\nGot a few good things to say about this particular Sen (means Lotus) restaurant. Great food, in comparision to many horrible buffet restaurant around town, great staff and service. The most dazzling thing about this place is the arranging of courses around the restaurant, very clever and quite elegant in presenting the dishes. Love to come back again, great place to have a buffet with decent price in Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 11, 2014",
