            "review_title": "Review at Sen Ha Thanh",
            "review_text": "Wong1129\nSingapore142 contributions\n0\nLocal food and more in a restaurant setting\nDec 2012 • Business\nThis is a restaurant where the only choice is buffet style but for around USD 15 per person. It has a large spread of food from BBQ to Japanese, but what was great for me was the four street style food stalls they had in one area of the restaurant where they prepare the food as you order. I tried most of what they offered and it was great. They had local noodles, congee and if you like innards then this is highly recommended, I had been to Hanoi for many business trips and tried various restaurants and I highly recommend this, the only drawback is your stomach will be stretched when you leave this place\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 9, 2012",
