            "review_title": "Review at Sen Ha Thanh",
            "review_text": "MattB\nHua Hin, Thailand383 contributions\n0\nQuantity, quality, price ... can't go wrong.\nApr 2012 • Friends\nI have been twice to this restaurant, and I must say I was nicely surprised. For about $15 you have a buffet with extensive selection of food. Various salads, sushi and sashimi, raw oysters (that I will judge safe to eat since I haven't been sick), spring rolls (fresh and fried) and much more. They also bring some special dishes to your table like cheese stuffed lobster... :-) \nThe only downside is that the place is often extremely noisy with locals, and full of kids running everywhere.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 23, 2012",
